_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Gold Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">5 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Treasure of Crystal Cove</a></b>, Turn in <b>650</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Copper_Doubloon.png/25px-Copper_Doubloon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Copper_Doubloon.png 1.5x\" /></span></span> <span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove/Collectables#Doubloons\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove/Collectables\">Copper Doubloon</a></b></span></span><b>375</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Silver_Doubloon.png/25px-Silver_Doubloon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Silver_Doubloon.png 1.5x\" /></span></span> <span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove/Collectables#Doubloons\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove/Collectables\">Silver Doubloon</a></b></span></span><b>20</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Stolen_Amber.png/25px-Stolen_Amber.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Stolen_Amber.png 1.5x\" /></span></span> <span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove/Collectables#Stolen_Gems\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove/Collectables\">Stolen Amber</a></b></span></span> at <a href=\"/page/Dusty_Old_Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Dusty Old Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Dusty Old Treasure of Crystal Cove</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Enhancements\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_-_Tier_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable - Tier 1\">Upgradeable - Tier 1</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+2 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+2 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +2 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Parrying\" title=\"Parrying\">Parrying I</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Parrying\" title=\"Parrying\">Parrying I</a>:</b> Passive: +1 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>, +1 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Fortitude_save\" title=\"Fortitude save\">Fortitude</a>, <a href=\"/page/Reflex_save\" title=\"Reflex save\">Reflex</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Will_save\" title=\"Will save\">Will</a> <a href=\"/page/Saving_throw\" title=\"Saving throw\">Saving throws</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Doublestrike\" title=\"Doublestrike\"> Doublestrike 3%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Doublestrike\" title=\"Doublestrike\"> Doublestrike 3%</a>:</b> Passive: 3% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Doublestrike. (Doublestrike is a chance to score an additional hit with a melee attack.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Guardbreaking\" title=\"Guardbreaking\">Guardbreaking</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Guardbreaking\" title=\"Guardbreaking\">Guardbreaking</a>:</b> This item enables you to break an enemy's guard in between your melee attacks. On critical hits with your melee weapons, enemies will become <a href=\"/page/Dazed\" title=\"Dazed\">dazed</a> as a result.</span></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_-_Tier_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable - Tier 2\">Upgradeable - Tier 2</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+2 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+2 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +2 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span> &#8594; <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+3 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+3 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +3 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_-_Tier_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable - Tier 3\">Upgradeable - Tier 3</a>\n<ul><li>Adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Riposte\" title=\"Riposte\">Riposte</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Riposte\" title=\"Riposte\">Riposte</a>:</b> When its wearer is successfully attacked in melee, this shield occasionally allows him or her to make an immediate counterattack, dealing bludgeoning damage to the offending enemy.</span></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\"><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Treasure of Crystal Cove</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;background:#CCEEFF\"><i>An indispensable tool for many a pirate when dueling with a single blade. It can parry an enemy's blows effectively and even leave them open to counterattack.</i>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/page/Item:Swashbuckler\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Item:Swashbuckler\">Swashbuckler</a> - Full table of the Swashbuckler line<br /><br />\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>45</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Stolen_Amber.png/25p